  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHIA frame 2010</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">SHIA ram 2010</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fram support to SHIA 2010. SHIA is working in cooperation with a number of CSO&apos;s in Eastern Europe, which supports people with disabilities. The aim is to contribute to people with disabilities and their possibilites to improve their living conditions and to claim their rights.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ramst&#xF6;d till SHIAs verksamhet 2010. SHIA arbetar tillsammand med ett antal CSO&apos;s i Syd, som st&#xF6;djer m&#xE4;nniskor med funktionshinder. Syftet &#xE4;r att fr&#xE4;mja funktionshindrades m&#xF6;jligheter att f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra sina levnadsvillkor och att utkr&#xE4;va sina r&#xE4;ttigheter.</narrative>
  </description>
